@startuml
title Use Case 6.1: Notification View
actor User
participant NotificationCenter.vue
participant NotificationBell.vue
participant client.ts
participant notifications.py
participant notification_service.py
database MySQL

User -> NotificationBell.vue: Click notification bell
NotificationBell.vue -> client.ts: getNotifications()
client.ts -> notifications.py: GET /notifications
notifications.py -> notification_service.py: get_user_notifications()
notification_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT notifications WHERE user_id
MySQL --> notification_service.py: notifications[]
notification_service.py --> notifications.py: notifications
notifications.py --> client.ts: 200 OK
client.ts --> NotificationBell.vue: notifications
NotificationBell.vue --> User: Show notification dropdown

User -> NotificationCenter.vue: Click See All
NotificationCenter.vue -> client.ts: getNotifications(all)
client.ts -> notifications.py: GET /notifications?page=1
notifications.py -> notification_service.py: get_user_notifications()
notification_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT notifications
MySQL --> notification_service.py: notifications[]
notification_service.py --> notifications.py: result
notifications.py --> client.ts: 200 OK
client.ts --> NotificationCenter.vue: notifications
NotificationCenter.vue --> User: Display full list
@enduml